<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Overboard</title>
<style>
  html, body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: #0c1014; overflow: hidden; overscroll-behavior: none; }
  #c { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; }
  #c.drag { cursor: grabbing; }
  #c:focus { outline: none; }
  #ui {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
    color: #d8c4a0; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 14, 0.78); pointer-events: none;
  }
  #ui h1 {
    font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 12px; font-size: 46px; margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #f0e0c0;
  }
  #ui p { margin: 5px 0; color: #8a7a62; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; }
  #ui .big { color: #e8d4a8; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 16px; }
  #hud {
    position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 16px; text-align: center;
    color: #8a7a62; font: 13px Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: 1px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #turn {
    position: fixed; top: 16px; left: 18px;
    font: 18px Georgia, serif; color: #f0e0c0; pointer-events: none;
  }
  #turn b { font-weight: 400; color: #c8a060; }
  #side {
    position: fixed; top: 16px; right: 18px; text-align: right;
    font: 13px Georgia, serif; color: #8a7a62; pointer-events: none;
  }
  #elo {
    position: fixed; top: 52px; right: 16px; width: 232px;
    background: rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.72); border: 1px solid #3a3226;
    padding: 12px 14px 10px; color: #d8c4a0;
    font: 13px Georgia, serif; z-index: 4;
  }
  #elo .elabel { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  #elo b { color: #f0e0c0; font-weight: 400; }
  #elo input[type=range] { width: 100%; accent-color: #c8a060; cursor: pointer; }
  #elopresets { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
  #elo button {
    background: #1a1814; color: #c8b490; border: 1px solid #4a4030;
    font: 12px Georgia, serif; padding: 3px 7px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  #elo button.on { background: #3a3020; color: #f0e0c0; border-color: #c8a060; }
  #aitog { width: 100%; margin-top: 4px; padding: 6px !important; }
  #engines, #colors { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin: 6px 0; }
  #engines button, #colors button { flex: 1; }
  #sfstat { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: #7a6a52; }
  #sfstat a { color: #c8a060; }
  #err {
    position: fixed; top: 10px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: #ff6b6b; font: 12px Consolas, monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; display: none;
  }
  html.embed #ui h1 { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 8px; }
  html.embed #ui p { font-size: 12px; }
  html.embed #ui .big { font-size: 15px; }
  html.embed #turn { font-size: 14px; top: 10px; left: 10px; }
  html.embed #side { top: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 11px; }
  html.embed #elo {
    top: auto; bottom: 40px; right: 8px; width: 176px;
    padding: 8px 10px 8px; font-size: 11px;
  }
  html.embed #hud { bottom: 8px; font-size: 11px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="c"></canvas>
<div id="ui">
  <h1>OVERBOARD</h1>
  <p>third-person chess &nbsp;·&nbsp; house engine or gambit engine</p>
  <p class="big">CLICK THE BOARD TO PLAY</p>
  <p>LEFT CLICK MOVE &nbsp; RIGHT DRAG ORBIT &nbsp; SCROLL ZOOM &nbsp; WASD ORBIT</p>
  <p>R NEW GAME &nbsp; T TOGGLE AI &nbsp; SET ELO ON THE RIGHT</p>
</div>
<div id="turn">WHITE TO MOVE</div>
<div id="side">AI plays black</div>
<div id="elo">
  <div class="elabel">AI ELO <b id="elonum">1200</b></div>
  <input id="eloslider" type="range" min="400" max="2200" step="50" value="1200">
  <div id="elopresets">
    <button type="button" data-elo="400">400</button>
    <button type="button" data-elo="800">800</button>
    <button type="button" data-elo="1200" class="on">1200</button>
    <button type="button" data-elo="1600">1600</button>
    <button type="button" data-elo="2000">2000</button>
    <button type="button" data-elo="2200">2200</button>
  </div>
